text:
Bulk-reduce force:true and waitForTimeout in remaining MYPR web e2e specs that other agents might miss. Workspace: [PATH]/Code/MYPR-App

## Priority: scan ALL client/e2e/web/specs/*.spec.ts

If a file still has many waitForTimeout or force:true after other agents, improve them:

Pattern for clicks:
```ts
try {
  await locator.click({ timeout: 8_000 });
} catch {
  await locator.click({ force: true, timeout: 5_000 });
}
```

Pattern for waits:
```ts
await expect(page.getByText(...)).toBeVisible({ timeout: ... });
// or expect.poll
// NEVER networkidle
```

## Coordination:
Other agents own most specs. If a file is mid-edit, still apply improvements carefully. Prefer:
- notificationPopupContract, arikFeedbackGate, journalistDeepCrud, adminCrudSearch, layoutDirection, publicJourneys, storeCaptures, membershipVariants

If another agent already fixed a file, skip or only fix remaining sleeps.

Also fix any broken imports (fixtures vs @playwright/test, throttlePause removal).

Run grep at end:
```
grep -rn 'waitForTimeout\|throttlePause' client/e2e/web --include='*.ts' | head -40
```
Report remaining counts.

Do not edit server or native. Return summary.
